OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, Nearly 60 people have been rescued
OL,6, after a US passenger jet crashed into
OL,7, the East River in New York.
OL,9,FThe US Air Boeing 737, flight 5050,
OL,10,Fcrashed shortly after take-off from
OL,11,FLa Guardia airport.
OL,13,FThe pilot tried to abort take-off at
OL,14,Fthe last minute, and the plane broke
OL,15,Finto three sections as it plunged into
OL,16,Fthe river.
OL,18,FTwo people are reported to have been
OL,19,Fkilled. A total of 45 people were taken
OL,20,Fto hospital; nine are said to be in a
OL,21,Fcritical condition.
OL,23,T]CFrom 21-09-89   teletextarchive.com
