OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, A High Court judge has ruled that a
OL,6, black child should have another chance
OL,7, with her natural mother before any
OL,8, decision on adoption can be taken.
OL,10,FMr Justice Cazalet said all parties
OL,11,Finvolved had agreed on a final effort
OL,12,Fto rehabilitate the baby with her
OL,13,F17-year-old black mother.
OL,15,FThe baby was taken from her mother
OL,16,Fearly in her life and the child's white
OL,17,Ffoster-mother asked Islington Council
OL,18,Fif she could adopt her permanently.
OL,20,FIslington Council does not allow black
OL,21,Fchildren to be adopted by white parents
OL,23,T]CFrom 21-09-89   teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
