OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, The Green Party's annual conference
OL,6, opened in Wolverhampton today with a
OL,7, condemnation of the Government's
OL,8, approach to green issues.
OL,10,FThe party's international secretary, Ms
OL,11,FSara Parkin, said the Government did
OL,12,Fnot understand the scale of the
OL,13,Fecological crisis facing the earth.
OL,15,FIt preferred to steal individual Green
OL,16,Fpolicies rather than adopt the whole
OL,17,FGreen approach, she said.
OL,19,S/FThe conference congratulated the
OL,20,FEuropean Commission for deciding to
OL,21,Fprosecute Britain over its dirty water.
OL,23,T]CFrom 21-09-89   teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
